{
	"uid": "know-traces",
	"title": "Know Traces",
	"description": "Tempo search / TraceQL for Know services",
	"tags": [
		"know",
		"traces",
		"tempo"
	],
	"timezone": "browser",
	"schemaVersion": 39,
	"version": 1,
	"editable": true,
	"graphTooltip": 1,
	"time": {
		"from": "now-1h",
		"to": "now"
	},
	"templating": {
		"list": [
			{
				"name": "service",
				"type": "custom",
				"label": "Service",
				"query": "admin,orchestrator,worker,subprocess",
				"includeAll": true,
				"multi": true,
				"allValue": ".*",
				"current": {
					"text": "All",
					"value": "$__all"
				}
			},
			{
				"name": "task_kind",
				"type": "custom",
				"label": "Task kind",
				"query": "generation,reindex",
				"includeAll": true,
				"multi": true,
				"allValue": ".*",
				"current": {
					"text": "All",
					"value": "$__all"
				}
			},
			{
				"name": "min_duration",
				"type": "custom",
				"label": "Min duration",
				"query": "0ms,100ms,500ms,1s,5s",
				"current": {
					"text": "0ms",
					"value": "0ms"
				}
			},
			{
				"name": "task_id",
				"type": "textbox",
				"label": "Task ID",
				"current": {
					"text": "",
					"value": ""
				}
			},
			{
				"name": "trace_id",
				"type": "textbox",
				"label": "Trace ID",
				"current": {
					"text": "",
					"value": ""
				}
			}
		]
	},
	"panels": [
		{
			"id": 1,
			"type": "text",
			"title": "How to use",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 5,
				"w": 24,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 0
			},
			"options": {
				"mode": "markdown",
				"content": "1. Select **Service** / **Task kind** / **Min duration**.\n2. Open a row in search panels → click **traceID** → full Trace View.\n3. From Trace View use **Logs** / **Metrics** (datasource already has tracesToLogs / tracesToMetrics).\n4. Paste **Task ID** or **Trace ID** into variables for focused panels.\n\nTraceQL cheatsheet:\n```\n{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" }\n{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && status = error }\n{ span.task.id = \"$task_id\" }\n{ span.http.route = \"/api/v1/tasks\" }\n{ resource.service.name = \"worker\" && duration > 1s }\n```"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 2,
			"type": "tempo-search",
			"title": "Recent traces (by service)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 12,
				"w": 24,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 5
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceqlSearch",
					"filters": [
						{
							"id": "service-name",
							"tag": "resource.service.name",
							"operator": "=~",
							"value": [
								"${service:regex}"
							],
							"scope": "resource"
						}
					],
					"limit": 20
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 3,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "TraceQL: service + min duration",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 24,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 17
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"${service:regex}\" && duration > 1s }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "Error traces",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 27
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && status = error }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 5,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "Worker task.process",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 27
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ resource.service.name = \"worker\" && name = \"task.process\" }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 6,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "By task.id (fill variable)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 37
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ span.task.id = \"$task_id\" }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "By trace id (fill variable)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 37
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query":"{ trace:id = \"$trace_id\" }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 8,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "HTTP 5xx (orchestrator/admin)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 47
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"orchestrator|admin\" && span.http.status_code >= 500 }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 9,
			"type": "traces",
			"title": "LLM spans",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 47
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "tempo",
				"uid": "tempo"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"queryType": "traceql",
					"query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && name =~ \"llm\\\\..*\" }"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 10,
			"type": "text",
			"title": "Shell equivalents",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 24,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 57
			},
			"options": {
				"mode": "markdown",
				"content": "```bash\n# tags / services\ncurl -sS http://localhost:3200/api/search/tags | jq\ncurl -sS -G http://localhost:3200/api/search/tag/service.name/values | jq\n\n# search\ncurl -sS -G http://localhost:3200/api/search \\\n  --data-urlencode 'tags=service.name=worker' --data-urlencode 'limit=10' | jq\n\n# one trace\ncurl -sS http://localhost:3200/api/traces/TRACE_ID | jq '.batches[0].resource.attributes'\n```\n\nUseful span attrs you already emit: `task.id`, `task.kind`, `task.action`, `task.final_status`, `http.route`, `http.status_code`, `llm.model`, `llm.latency_ms`, `subprocess.task_id`."
			}
		}
	]
}